WEBVTT

00:00.500 --> 00:04.400
Hello, everyone. We began playing the music to our plants.

00:05.400 --> 00:11.200
The first thing I noticed, you can see right here.

00:11.400 --> 00:16.300
We harvested our greens fifteen days early,

00:16.400 --> 00:21.200
and the goodness passes from the plants to us, too.

00:21.300 --> 00:25.800
Give it a try. You have nothing to lose.
